Thanks for the note of support!

Actually, I don't have a lot of time to work on it either at the moment. 
I'm in the midst of writing a Java book to be published early this 
summer, so that's got the bulk of my time. But I do have some N3/RDF 
syntax and vocabulary for the gismu already. I don't think I'll be able 
to put anything up on the site for awhile, perhaps not until April/May 
and until I've tested it thoroughly.

But stay tuned...

